<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's forex reserves fall slightly in July.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's forex reserves fall slightly in July.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves fell to $2.463 billion in July from $2.528 billion in June, compared to $2.085 billion in July 1995, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>    (MLN DLRS)		JULY	 JUNE	  JULY 1995</p>
<p>TOTAL			   2,463	2,528	 2,860</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	   1,263	  690	 1,814</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan	418	1,146	   256</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion	768	  691	   776</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights	 14	    1	    14</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
